        <mxCell id="s_s" value="Two structurally identical machines: pending → approved | rejected. What makes them worth drawing is the effect of approval, which is dispatched on requestType." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
